<title>USA: Sonat Offshore completes name change.</title>
<headline>Sonat Offshore completes name change.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sonat Offshore Drilling Inc said Thursday it has changed its corporate name to Transocean Offshore Inc following completion of its exchange offer for shares of Transocean ASA.</p>
<p>The company said that its stock will continue to trade on the New York Stock Exchange under the symbol &quot;RIG&quot;.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
